hich can be explored and excavated. (Introduction at the end of the article)<br><br>[Martial arts magic skills and props]<br>martial  (\u6b66\u672f)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240610/extras/60eb0ae76d45d05cf6590ecc7ec3ae65.poster.avif?t=1671791113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240610/extras/60eb0ae76d45d05cf6590ecc7ec3ae65.webm?t=1671791113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240610/extras/60eb0ae76d45d05cf6590ecc7ec3ae65.mp4?t=1671791113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Exercises (\u529f\u6cd5)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240610/extras/94a7d0316331affb4b3828070b129524.poster.avif?t=1671791113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240610/extras/94a7d0316331affb4b3828070b129524.webm?t=1671791113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240610/extras/94a7d0316331affb4b3828070b129524.mp4?t=1671791113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Props (\u9053\u5177):  You can try the explosive power of drunkenness, try to poison your opponent... It can be a chicken that has always been upright, or it can be used to control violence.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240610/extras/4e51b6b4f2f3590c5d5f312dfb6217e6.poster.avif?t=1671791113\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240610/extras/4e51b6b4f2f3590c5d5f312dfb6217e6.webm?t=1671791113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src